Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see, Raj was the kung pao chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉是宫保鸡丁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:05.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm the dumplings. -Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:05.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是水饺 -没错 你的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:08.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Creepy, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:08.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 真恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Creepy good or creepy bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的恶心还是坏的恶心？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:14.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who was the shrimp with lobster sauce? -That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:14.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁点了龙虾糊虾？ -是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come to Papa, you un-kosher delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 你这个不洁净的珍馐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not necessarily talking to the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我指的不见得是食物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐过去一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Baby wipe? -Why do you have--?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.13,0:00:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-婴儿湿巾？ -你为什么要用…？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, don't ask. -No, don't, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:48.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 别问 -不 千万别问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来告诉你们原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:51.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH SIGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:54.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to sanitize my hands because the university...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:54.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不得不清洁我的双手…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:57.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...replaced the paper towels in the restrooms with hot-air blowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:57.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为校方在厕所里 装了烘干机 取代擦手纸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:00.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought the blowers were more sanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:00.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为烘干机比较卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:01.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Really, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:01.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么要这么说？ -拜托 别再问了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hot-air blowers are incubators and spewers of bacteria and pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烘干机是细菌跟致命病毒的温床
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'd be more hygienic if they had a plague-infested gibbon...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫一只染上瘟疫的长臂猿打喷嚏 帮我吹干双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sneeze my hands dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还更卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys. I just got the most amazing new--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.99,0:01:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我有个天大的好消…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:21.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think you'll ever be able to talk in front of me without being drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:21.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你什么时候才能不借着喝醉 才敢在我面前说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, I'll just go eat by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我自己吃好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:29.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You don't have to do that. -It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:29.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-亲爱的 你不必这么做 -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.51,0:01:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Between him not talking, him talking, and him...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.51,0:01:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不说话 他却滔滔不绝 而他则…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm better off alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己吃比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So goodbye, you poor, strange little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 你这个可怜又奇怪的小人儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-She's so considerate. -So, what's your news?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:46.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她真体贴 -有什么好消息？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:49.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember that little object I spotted beyond the Kuiper belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:49.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得我在柯伊伯带发现的小行星？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, 2008-NQ sub-17.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:52.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得 2008NQ17
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or as I call it, Planet Bollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者我给它起的名字 宝莱坞行星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, because of my discovery...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正有鉴于我的新发现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...People magazine is naming me one of their 30 Under 30 to Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《人物》杂志将我列为值得注意的 30岁以下的30个大名人之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Raj, that's incredible. -Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拉吉 真是太好了 -恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:09.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, 30 what under 30 what to watch what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:09.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕我唐突 值得注意什么30以下的30什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thirty visionaries under 30 years of age to watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}值得注意的30位30岁以下…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as they challenge the preconceptions of the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}具有远见、探索其领域的精英
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I had a million guesses, I never would have gotten that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算让我猜一百万次 我也猜不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:23.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They've got me in with a guy doing something about hunger in Indonesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:23.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这很棒 我跟印尼的拯救饥荒专家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a psychotherapist using dolphins to rehabilitate prisoners...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及用海豚 对犯人矫正治疗的心理医生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Ellen Page, star of the charming independent film Juno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电影《朱诺》的女星 艾伦珮吉同时在列
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'd so do her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:34.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好想上她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd do the dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你连海豚都会上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I get a mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会有荣誉奖吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for designing the telescope camera mounting bracket?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为是我帮你设计 望远镜的摄影机架设器？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, it's not part of my heartwarming and personal narrative...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 不在我衷心感激的个人谢辞里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in which a humble boy from New Delhi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个来自新德里的谦虚男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:53.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...overcame poverty and prejudice and journeyed to America to reach for the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:53.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克服贫穷与偏见 飘洋过海来到美国摘星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:57.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Poverty? Your father's a gynecologist. He drives a Bentley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:57.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贫穷？你爸是个妇科医生 他还开宾利轿车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:02:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:02:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是租的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused. Was there some sort of peer-review committee...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂 是否有同侪审查委员会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to determine which scientists would be included?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来决定哪些科学家该被提名？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:13.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Peer review? It's People magazine. People picked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:13.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同侪审查？这是《人物》杂志 人们选择我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What people? -The people from People.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哪些人？ -《人物》杂志的那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:18.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Yeah, but exactly who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:18.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}精确来说 到底是哪些人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are their credentials? How are they qualified?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们的可信度如何？他们够格吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What makes accidentally noticing a hunk of rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁决定一个不小心发现…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that's been traipsing around the solar system for billions of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}环绕太阳系几十亿年的小石头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...more noteworthy than any other scientific accomplishment by someone under 30?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要比其他30岁以下的 科学家更有成就？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:36.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, I bet Ellen Page's friends aren't giving her this kind of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:36.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我敢打赌 艾伦珮吉的朋友不会这样浇她冷水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You proud of yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感到自豪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In general, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总的来说 的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, there's my missing neutrino.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢 不见的微中子原来在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were hiding from me as an unbalanced charge...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一直躲着我让我的方程式不平衡…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:22.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...weren't you, you little subatomic dickens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:22.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是 你这个次原子小东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Sheldon. -Hey, look, I found my missing neutrino.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 谢尔顿 -你看 我找到了失踪的微中子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, we can take it off the milk carton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 可以从鲜奶瓶上拿下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna apologize to Raj and invite him out to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要去向拉吉道歉 请他吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apologize? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}道歉？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:39.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He came over last night with some pretty good news and we weren't very supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:39.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他昨晚带着好消息过来 我们却不够朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sense you're trying to tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我感觉到你们想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were a colossal asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:46.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的表现最糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of the three of us, I was by far the most supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们三人当中 我是最够朋友的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How will Raj ever reach true greatness if his friends lower the bar for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为他的朋友 如果降低标准 拉吉又怎能成为伟人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:03.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was 11, my sister bought our father a "world's greatest dad" coffee mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:03.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我11岁时 我妹送我爸一个 “世上第一老爸”的杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And frankly, the man coasted until the day he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 他后来的表现一路下滑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's try it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们不妨这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:12.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if this People magazine thing is the best Raj is going to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:12.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一登上《人物》杂志 将是拉吉一生最高的成就呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I had not considered that. -Mm-hm. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没想到这一点 -走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I often forget other people have limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我时常忘记别人是有上限的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真令人悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He can feel sadness? -Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他懂得悲伤？ -不见得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's what you and I call condescension.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是我们所说的 屈尊就卑的假惺惺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, when we go in there, let's show Raj that we're happy for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们进去时 要让拉吉知道我们替他高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then fake it. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假装一下 看看我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:42.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could be grinding on the fact that without my stabilizing telescope mount...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:42.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果没有我设计的装置 他不可能发现那颗小石头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he never would have found that stupid little clump of cosmic schmutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:46.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该为此气得咬牙切齿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:50.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我大人有大量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你们要我怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, crap, that's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're here to see Koothrappali, not kill Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是来找库萨帕里 不是来干掉蝙蝠侠的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Try less teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别露出那么多的牙齿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Close enough. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}差不多了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Raj. -Hey, guys. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 拉吉 -各位 有何贵干？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We wanted to invite you out to dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚想请你吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Celebrate your 30 Under 30 thing. Right, Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}庆祝你那个30个名人的东西 你说是不是 谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's very nice of you. I would like that. -Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们真好 我乐意之至 -大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Gablehauser. -Dr. Koothrappali.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖布尓豪瑟博士 -库萨帕里博士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Gablehauser. -Dr. Hofstadter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖布尓豪瑟博士 -霍夫斯塔特博士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Gablehauser. -Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖布尓豪瑟博士 -库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Gablehauser. -Mr. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖布尓豪瑟博士 -沃洛维茨先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boys, I got a question for you. Who in this room discovered a star?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 问你们一个问题 这个房间里 谁发现了星星？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, 2008-NQ sub-17 is a planetary body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 2008NQ17是个行星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not talking about you, I'm talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说的不是你 而是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:07:01.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You, my exotic young friend, are my star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:07:01.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就是我的星星 异国风情的年轻朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you didn't discover him. You merely noticed he was here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你没有发现他 你差点没注意到他在此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...much like he did with 2008-NQ sub-17.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像他差点没注意到2008NQ17
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:10.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon. -Ugh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:10.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:17.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, we gotta get you into a better office. Something more suited to your status.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:17.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得帮你找个好一点的研究室 好配得上你的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You don't have to go to trouble. -How about von Gerlach's old office?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的不用麻烦了 -凡格拉赫的旧研究室如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'd rather have Fishbein's. It's bigger. GABLEHAUSER: Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要费须本的研究室 比较大 -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, I called dibs on Fishbein's office...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从他穿着睡袍出现在研究室起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:29.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the day he started showing up at work in his bathrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:29.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就先说好要他的研究室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He gets a new office, I can't get paper towels in the men's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有新的研究室 我却连厕所擦手纸也没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon. -Damn, this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -该死 忍不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:45.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me ask you, what do you think the business of this place is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:45.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我问你们 这个地方是在做什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Science? -Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-科学？ -金钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this boy's picture in People magazine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这男孩的照片出现在《人物》杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is gonna raise us a pile of money taller than--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将为我们筹到一大叠的经费
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, taller than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至比你还高
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I have a master's degree. -Who doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有硕士学位 -谁没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Koothrappali, have you ever had lunch in the president's dining room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里博士 你可曾在院长餐厅用过餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't even know there was a president's dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我甚至不知道有个院长餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the same food as the cafeteria, only fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菜色跟自助餐厅的一样 只不过更新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, little buddy. -Okay, big buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走吧 小家伙 -好 大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See you tonight, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚见 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You can stop smiling now. -Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以不用笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway, after a fantastic lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃完超赞的午餐后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was whisked off to the People magazine photo shoot--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赶到《人物》杂志拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have any of you been to a photo shoot? HOWARD: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们以前拍过杂志照吗？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:43.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, the camera loves me, and I it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:43.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显而易见 我很上相
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They shot me in front of a starry background where I posed like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拍摄的背景是星空 我摆着这样的姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:56.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're going to digitally add a supernova.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:56.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们打算通过数码合成加上超新星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They say it's the perfect metaphor for my incandescent talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说这是我耀眼才华的完美隐喻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, a ball of hot, flaming gas that collapses upon itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一团炽热燃烧的气体 自我爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:06.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CELL PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 是我的助理特雷弗打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Oh, it's my assistant, Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:10.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go for Koothrappali. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:10.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是库萨帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They gave him an assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们给他一个助理？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I want a new pen, I have to go to the bank with wire cutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我连要一支笔 都得带着老虎钳到银行才行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have we at this point met our social obligations?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们现在够朋友了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:20.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, put it on my calendar, but start thinking of a reason why I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 安排进我的行程 开始想想我不能出席的借口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alrighty? Koothrappali out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？我挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God bless that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上帝保佑他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:31.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't know what I'd do without him. -You just got him this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:31.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有他 我真不知道该怎么办？ -他今天下午才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but I'm finding that having a lackey suits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我认为有个仆人使唤 相当适合我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A lackey? -I'm sorry, is that politically incorrect?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-仆人？ -抱歉 这样会冒犯别人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In India, we just call them untouchables.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在印度 我们直接叫他们贱民
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now? -Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以走了吗？ -快了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Speaking of untouchables, I've got great news for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说到贱民 我有个好消息要告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People magazine is having a reception Saturday, and I managed to get you invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《人物》杂志周六要举行晚宴 我帮你们拿到了邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:56.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, gee, thanks. -Oh, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:56.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, I couldn't get you into the VIP section...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 我没办法拿到贵宾席
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:03.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because, you know, that's for VIPs, and you guys are just, you know, P's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:03.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为那是保留给贵宾的 你们只是来宾而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a tribe in Papua New Guinea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在巴布亚新几内亚有个部落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where when a hunter flaunts his success to the rest of the village...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当猎人向全村人炫耀他的战果时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they kill him and drive away evil spirits with a drum made of his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们会把他杀了 用他的皮做的大鼓来驱赶恶灵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:19.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superstitious nonsense, of course, but one can see their point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:19.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是个迷信 但你们应该懂我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go, Raj. You might wanna drink this one slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这杯给你 拉吉 你慢点喝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. So Saturday night, can I count on my posse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 周末夜 谁要一起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:36.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, I'd love to, Raj, but I can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:36.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很想去 拉吉 但我有事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I could-- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我应该…我有事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon? -I can make it, but I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿？ -我没事 但我不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you talking about? -The reception for my article on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们在说什么？ -周六有庆祝我的文章上杂志的晚宴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:53.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys aren't going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:53.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不去？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you. Raj is celebrating a tremendous accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:57.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真令人难以相信 拉吉要庆祝他的伟大成就
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:59.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:59.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们却不在他的身旁支持他？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A tremendous accomplishment would be if the planetary body he discovered...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他发现的行星即将撞上地球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...were plummeting toward Earth and he exploded it with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他能用脑子炸开它 这才叫做伟大的成就
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be cool. I'd go to that reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那一定很棒 我一定会去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, this is huge. Raj is gonna be in People magazine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 这可不是小事 拉吉就要上《人物》杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he didn't even have to knock up one of the Spears sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他甚至不必让布兰妮姐妹怀孕 就做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you like to go with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你愿意跟我一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:23.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I would. I would be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:23.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然愿意 这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shame on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真该为自己感到羞愧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:32.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at that, I got a date with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:32.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们瞧 我要跟佩妮去约会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe it took you a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信你居然花了一年的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now? -Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以走了吗？ -我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, buddy. I'm gonna be in People magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 我要上《人物》杂志了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, call me when you're on the cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等你上了封面再说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Raj, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I'm resplendent like the noonday sun, am I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我就像正午的太阳 一样耀眼 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:11.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yeah. Starting with the champagne a little early, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:11.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在就喝香槟会不会太早？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was in the limo. They sent a limo. I have a limo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我坐礼车来的 他们派了礼车来 我有辆礼车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just love saying "limo." Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢说礼车这个词 给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:20.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sip on this while you're getting ready. -Oh, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:20.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你换衣服的时候可以喝 -我已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what you're wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算穿这身衣服去？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yeah. Why? What's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 不妥吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:32.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I was just hoping for something a little more, you know, ridonkulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:32.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 我只是希望 你能穿得更闪亮动人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Well, this is all the "donkulous" you're gonna get tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今晚只好凑合了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okey-dokey. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, it's time to raise the roof. Ooh-ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 我们要狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You look very nice. BOTH: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你穿得真漂亮 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on. Good night, Leonard. -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-走吧 晚安 莱纳德 -晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:03.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, did you see my limo downstairs? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:03.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 你看见楼下的礼车了吗？ -看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:06.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's bigger than the house my grandfather grew up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:06.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比我爷爷小时候住的房子还大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:08.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Terrific. -It has more food too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:08.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太好了 -食物也更多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH [SINGING]: I'm coming up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you better get this party started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:18.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm coming up I'm coming up, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:22.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm coming up So you better get this party started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey, good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -嘿 好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to sulk about Penny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不必再为佩妮伤神了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are hundreds of Croatian women just waiting for you to contact them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有上百名克罗地亚小姐 等你跟她们联络
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Anything-for-a-Green-Card.com"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切为了绿卡网站？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:39.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll lend you my username. It's Wealthy Big Penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:39.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以用我的帐号 就叫做富裕的大阳具
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're joking. -You gotta make it easy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说真的？ -必须尽量简单一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're just learning English.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们才刚开始学英文
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're just gonna sit around here and mope...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当佩妮跟快易店的阿普博士约会时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while Penny is out with Dr. Apu from the Kwik-E-Mart?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就只打算坐在这里唉声叹气？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a date and that's racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是约会 你有种族歧视
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:02.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It can't be racist. He's a beloved character on The Simpsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:02.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不是种族歧视 他是 《辛普森一家》里受人爱戴的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's just eat so I can get to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶快吃吧 我好早点睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With any luck, tonight will be the night my sleep apnea kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸运的话 我今晚可以死于睡眠窒息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you ask for the chicken to be diced, not shredded?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有叫他们把鸡肉切丁 而不是切丝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Even though the menu specifies shredded?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -尽管他们菜单上已经声明切丝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Brown rice, not white?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -糙米 不是白米？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:21.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Did you stop and get the hot mustard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:21.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}路过韩国杂货店 帮我买了芥末酱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Did you pick up the low-sodium soy sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你买了低钠酱油吗？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么去了这么久？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just sit down and eat. -Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-坐下来吃吧 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:39.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, it's shredded. What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:39.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这是切丝的 你要我怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to check before you accept the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你看清楚再收货
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were you distracted by the possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是因为 库萨帕里可能跟佩妮发生关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that Koothrappali might have intercourse with Penny tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你因此分心？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not going to have intercourse with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不会跟佩妮发生关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then there's no excuse for this chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:56.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样你就更没有借口了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, this situation with Koothrappali brings to mind a story from my childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里这件事 让我回想起小时候的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, goody, more tales from the panhandle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 又讲来自潘汉德的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's Northwest Texas. I'm from East Texas, the Gulf region...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是在德州西北方 而我是住在德州东部 高尔夫地区
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...home to many Vietnamese shrimpers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}许多越南捕虾人的家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do the shrimpers feature in your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这故事里有捕虾人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, when I was 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}言归正传 在我八岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a Montgomery Ward delivery van ran over our family cat, Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们家的猫 吉利 被车子碾死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-"Lucky"? -Yes, "Lucky."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-吉利？ -是的 吉利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:31.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's irony impaired. Just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:31.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他根本听不懂讽刺 继续说就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, dead cat named Lucky. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 死掉的猫叫做吉利 继续说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While others mourned Lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当其他人在为吉利伤心时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I realized his untimely demise provided me with the opportunity to replace him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我意识到它不幸去世后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:44.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with something more suited to my pet needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:44.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反而让我有机会 换一只更适合我的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A faithful companion that I could snuggle with at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:47.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我晚上可以抱着睡觉的忠实伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...yet would be capable of killing upon telepathic command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又能接受心电感应 执行暗杀任务
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:55.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So not a puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:55.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是小狗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. No, nothing so pedestrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不是 才不是这么平凡的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted a griffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想要一只半狮半鹫的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A griffin? -Yes, half eagle, half lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-半狮半鹫的怪兽？ -是的 一半是鹫 一半是狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And mythological.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还充满神话色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:13.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I was studying recombinant DNA technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:13.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当时正在学习基因重组科技
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I was confidant I could create one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有信心能够创造一只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but my parents were unwilling to secure the necessary eagle eggs and lion semen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而我爸妈却不愿给我 需要的鹫蛋跟狮子精液
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:25.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, my sister got swimming lessons when she wanted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:25.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妹妹想上游泳课 他们就答应
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:33.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, not that we don't all enjoy a good lion-semen story...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:33.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 倒不是我不喜欢 这个狮子精液的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的重点是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My point is, if Koothrappali is moving on to a new life of shallow, undeserved fame...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的重点是 如果库萨帕里 想过着肤浅、虚名的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then perhaps this is an opportunity to create a better cohort.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这正是 我们创造更好伙伴的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna breed a new friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想培育一个新朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's one option, but who has the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是一个选择 但谁有时间呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想想看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Japanese, they're doing some wonderful work with artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}日本人的人工智慧研究先进突出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:17:00.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, combine that with some animatronics from the imagineers over at Disney.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:17:00.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结合迪士尼的电子动画技术后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:05.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next thing you know, we're playing "Halo" with a multilingual Abraham Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:05.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就可以跟多才多艺的林肯 一起玩《光晕》了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, don't take this the wrong way, but you're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 别误解我的好意 但你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That may well be, but the fact is it wouldn't kill us to meet some new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:14.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管如此 见见新朋友也不至于害死我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the record, it could kill us to meet new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟新人见面有可能会害死我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They could be murderers or the carriers of unusual pathogens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可能是杀人犯 或是奇特病原体的携带者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:27.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm not insane. My mother had me tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:27.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也没有发疯 我妈带我去医院检查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we do get a new friend, he should be a guy you can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们要交新朋友 他必须是个我们能够信赖的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, a guy who has your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个随时随地在你身旁的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He should have money and live in a cool place by the beach where we throw parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要有钱 住在海边的大屋子里 可以天天举行派对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He should share our love of technology. -And he should know a lot of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他得喜欢科技才行 -他得认识很多女人才行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's see, money, women, technology. Okay, we're agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 金钱、女人、科技 我们都同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:51.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our new friend is going to be Iron Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:51.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的新朋友会是钢铁侠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:56.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH [SINGING]: I can go all night
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you know what I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome to the Raj Mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎来到拉吉玛哈陵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it's very nice. Good night, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 地方不错 晚安 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait, the evening's not over. -Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-慢着 今晚还没结束 -已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's time to put on some R. Kelly and suck face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该是我们打扮打扮互舔对方的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow, is the evening over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[COMPUTER BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:16.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait, wait. That's my mommy and daddy calling from India.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:18.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈从印度打来的 我要你见见我爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to meet my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:20.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:20.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 跟他们见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:27.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Mommy, Daddy. Good to see you. How are you? I'm not drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:27.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好 爸妈 真高兴看到你们 你们好吗？我没喝醉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:31.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why would you say that? -Just making conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:31.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你为什么这么说？ -随口说说而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mommy, Daddy, I want you to meet my new squeeze, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸妈妈 我要你们 见见我的女友佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:37.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not your squeeze. There is no squeezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:37.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是你的女友 我们没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't see her. Center her in the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看不到她 把屏幕对准她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go. Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们请看 很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:45.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not Indian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:45.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不是印度人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she's not Indian. The boy's sowing some wild oats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不是印度人又如何？ 孩子只是在外面采野花而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no, there's no sowing, no squeezing and no sucking face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不是采野花 不是女友 也不要舔脸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if he gets her pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一他让她怀孕怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this hotsy-totsy who you want as the mother of your grandchildren?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算让这个辣妹 当你孙子的母亲吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:01.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What right do you have to pick whom I can have children with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:01.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们无权决定我跟谁生孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Rajesh, I understand, you're in America...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 拉吉希 我了解你身在美国
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you want to try the "local cuisine."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要尝尝当地美食
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But trust me, you don't want it for a steady diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:10.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 你每天吃会不消化的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:15.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you listen to me. I am no longer a child and I will not be spoken to like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:15.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我听清楚 我已经不是小孩了 别用这种语气跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, if you'll excuse me, I have to go throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕我告退 我要去吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:22.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's wrong with him? PENNY: I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:22.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他怎么了？ -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:25.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's the local cuisine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:25.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是水土不服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴跟你们见面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:36.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just gonna set you on down over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:36.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要把你们放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:39.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm gonna leave, so namaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:39.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And FYI, you'd be lucky to have me as a daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有我这样的媳妇 应该是你们的运气才对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她很活泼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHUFFLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:11.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no notes. If you have something to say to me, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:11.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 别用纸条 有话想说 就当面说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE] Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:31.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:31.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
